  "mu_name": "Statue of Saint",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain _enum.h MONSTER_STATUE_OF_SAINT_3 (134), drawn as MODEL_STATUE_OF_SAINT (Monster61.bmd) as the first statue is; WebZen raises one of the three at random each run (BloodCastle.cpp:2216). The client's name is 성자의석관 (ZzzCharacter.cpp:13422).",
  "world": "bloodcastle",
