  },
  "monster_from": "ZzzCharacter.cpp:13416-13423, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_STATUE_OF_SAINT_1: OpenMonsterModel(MONSTER_MODEL_STATUE_OF_SAINT); CreateCharacter(Key, MODEL_STATUE_OF_SAINT, ...); NotRotateOnMagicHit; Scale = 0.8f; EnableShadow = false (a shadow here, not carried). It never moves or strikes (WebZen gObjMonster.cpp:1524-1529, ObjAttack.cpp:2713-2719).",
  "profile": "monster",
  "rig_from": "No rig: the stone never moves, and MU's geometry at action 0 key 0 is the .obj (the staff baked into it on Bone01's frame, see staff_from). A carved saint lying on his stone coffin -- 성자의석관 -- 374 units long and the staff standing from it; it lies on the wedge of stone beside its tile (Object13), drawn 120 forward of it as MuMain draws it (ZzzObject.cpp:276-282; play_show.cpp), its back along the stone's slope (Realm::raise).",
  "sheets": {
    "skR": "saintstatue_skr.png",
    "crossbow06_R": "crossbow06_r.png",
    "crossbow06": "crossbow06.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "skR.OZJ, 256x128, no alpha: blue-grey stone carved with robed figures, the statue's 448 triangles, decoded under a saintstatue_ prefix. And the weapon's two sheets, shared with its item: crossbow06_R, crossbow06.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "skR": "rock",
    "crossbow06_R": "painted_steel",
    "crossbow06": "painted_steel"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "Carved stone throughout: rock.",
  "sounds_from": "ZzzOpenData.cpp:3800-3801: MONSTER_MODEL_STATUE_OF_SAINT loads no sound and sets none.",
  "staff_from": "RenderCharacter, ZzzCharacter.cpp:8952-8966: this statue's Wing part is the Divine Crossbow of Archangel (Bow19) on bone 1, and RenderLinkObject's Link branch gives it AngleMatrix(10, 0, 0) and the offset (0, 110, 80) (:6684-6699), drawn at BodyScale 0.9 against the statue's 0.8. Baked into this mesh where that puts it -- 0.9/0.8 * Bone01 * Matrix * v, in MU's axes -- by tools/merge_statue_weapon.py (2026-10-03), which reproduces SaintStatue01's staff to the vertex.",
